          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. I need an AC tune-up. Friday at two PM.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure. I can set up a cooling tune up for Friday. First, what's the address for the visit?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Two forty-eight Duffield Street. Brooklyn.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it. 248 Duffield Street.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Hello?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry. I'm still here. Is the address 248 Duffield Street in Brooklyn 11201?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. That's correct.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "What's the best phone number to reach",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Are you gonna ask me a question? I'm calling from this number.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "About that. I'll use the number you're calling from. Let me check Friday's times. Friday, have twelve to four. Does that work?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Why can't you check Friday at two PM? That's the time I asked for.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I can only offer arrival windows, and twelve to four is the one that holds 2PM on Friday. The technician can arrive anytime in that window. Does Friday",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah, that's fine. Take the afternoon window. Friday.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Have your home at 248 Duffield Street, Brooklyn, zip code 11201. And the best number is (347) 555-0213. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. That's correct. Also, can someone call me tomorrow at ten AM about a new thermostat?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "It. First, I'll book the Friday tune up. Thanks. And what name should I put the visit under?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Jackson Lee. I just gave you the name.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Perfect. Booking that now. You're all set for Friday, November 6 with the technician arriving between twelve and four. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. Can someone call me tomorrow at ten AM about a new thermostat?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thermostat is an install quote, so I'll pass that along to our sales team. Someone from our team will call you tomorrow around 10AM to tell you more. Anything else?",
