          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I'm looking to set up a new account. I need an AC tune-up.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure. I can help with that. What's the address where you'd like to tune",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. One nine nine East fourth Street.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Let me look up that address. What's the ZIP code there?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Unit two.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it. Unit 2. And what's the zip code for the building?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "One zero zero zero nine.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Let me check that it's in our service area. Before I book, I need to check one thing. We cover Brooklyn, Queens, and Staten Island, so I wanna be sure this address is...",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Wait. Say that again? Is that all?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry. Let me say it plainly. We work in Brooklyn, Queens, and Staten Island. Is this addressing one of those?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. That's correct. It's in Manhattan. So, what's next?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "For telling me. Unfortunately, Summitter doesn't cover Manhattan, so we can't book a tune up at that address. I'm sorry about that. You may want to look for a local heating and cooling company that's...",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Wait. Say that again?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "We don't cover Manhattan. Summit Air serves Brooklyn, Queens, and Staten Island, so we can't book this tune up. You'd want a heating and cooling company that",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. That's all.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Is there anything else I can help with? Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
