          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Hi. This is Summit Air. Is this Maria?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah, I'm just wondering if I can cancel my appointment.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure. What are you wondering about? I can help with that. Can I ask what changed?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. The heat came back on by itself.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Glad it's back on. Before I cancel one thing, your visit was for Monday between twelve and four. Did the technician come by then or did it not happen?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "No, it's not Monday. It's today. Two PM.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Okay. So the visit you have is today between two, and let me check that for you. That visit is canceled. If you'd like another time, I have today twelve to four, today four to eight.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Wait. Say that again?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure. Today, Thursday, November 5, I have twelve to four, four to eight in the evening. Would either of those work? Or do you wanna",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Neither. Just cancel it. Is that all?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Yes. That's all. Your visit is canceled. Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
